('wikiloc', '175785808', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/r593-la-soca-100cims-175785808', 'R593 - La Soca (100cims)', '{"en":"Circular from Montferrer, Brigader spring","ca":"Circular des de Montferrer, Font del Brigader","es":"Circular desde Montferrer, Fuente del Brigader"}'::jsonb, 'R593 - La Soca (100cims) Hiking trail in Montferrer, Occitanie (France). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta circular des de Montferrer passant per:
- Pic de la Soca Sud (4.3 km)
- Font del Brigader (7.1 km)', '{"en":"This easy 10.9 km loop to La Soca starts from Montferrer, offering a pleasant circular route. The trail passes by the Pic de la Soca Sud at 4.3 km and continues towards the Font del Brigader at 7.1 km, before completing the loop.\n\nWith a total elevation gain of 598 meters, this route is suitable for hikers seeking an accessible and enjoyable day in the mountains, combining summit views with a visit to a natural spring.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 10.9 km a la Soca comença des de Montferrer, oferint un agradable recorregut circular. El sender passa pel Pic de la Soca Sud als 4.3 km i continua cap a la Font del Brigader als 7.1 km, abans de completar la volta.\n\nAmb un desnivell positiu total de 598 metres, aquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes que busquen una jornada accessible i agradable a la muntanya, combinant vistes des del cim amb una visita a una font natural.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 10.9 km a La Soca comienza desde Montferrer, ofreciendo un agradable recorrido circular. El sendero pasa por el Pic de la Soca Sud a los 4.3 km y continúa hacia la Font del Brigader a los 7.1 km, antes de completar la vuelta.\n\nCon un desnivel positivo total de 598 metros, esta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas que buscan una jornada accesible y agradable en la montaña, combinando vistas desde la cima con una visita a una fuente natural."}'::jsonb, 'joaquim100cims', 10863, 598, 598, 1640, 1027, 'easy', 'loop', 9360, 15420, 1905, '2024-06-29', '2024-05', '[{"lat":42.441547,"lng":2.559083,"ele":1029.2},{"lat":42.441503,"lng":2.559055,"ele":1028},{"lat":42.441463,"lng":2.559025,"ele":1027.7},{"lat":42.441417,"lng":2.55902,"ele":1027.8},{"lat":42.441371,"lng":2.559006,"ele":1027.9},{"lat":42.441323,"lng":2.55902,"ele":1027.9},{"lat":42.441271,"lng":2.559027,"ele":1027.9},{"lat":42.441222,"lng":2.559052,"ele":1028},{"lat":42.441175,"lng":2.559041,"ele":1028.4},{"lat":42.441129,"lng":2.559024,"ele":1028.9},{"lat"