- Coll de la Cirera (65.1 km)', '{"en":"This challenging three-stage loop around the Canigó massif, including the summit, covers 67.5 km with over 4100 m of elevation gain. The route explores the diverse landscapes of the Eastern Pyrenees, from the Conflent, Vallespir, and Roussillon regions, offering a comprehensive tour of this emblematic peak.\n\nThe Canigó, historically considered the highest peak in the Pyrenees due to its dramatic rise from sea level, presents significant elevation changes. This multi-day trek is suitable for experienced hikers seeking a grand tour of the mountain, combining long distances with substantial climbing.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular de tres etapes al voltant del massís del Canigó, incloent el cim, recorre 67,5 km amb més de 4100 m de desnivell positiu. La ruta explora els diversos paisatges dels Pirineus Orientals, des de les comarques del Conflent, Vallespir i Rosselló, oferint un recorregut complet per aquesta emblemàtica muntanya.\n\nEl Canigó, considerat històricament el cim més alt dels Pirineus per la seva impressionant elevació des del nivell del mar, presenta desnivells molt destacats. Aquesta travessa de diversos dies és adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que busquen una gran volta a la muntanya, combinant llargues distàncies amb pujades substancials.","es":"Esta desafiante ruta circular de tres etapas alrededor del macizo del Canigó, incluyendo la cima, recorre 67,5 km con más de 4100 m de desnivel positivo. La ruta explora los diversos paisajes de los Pirineos Orientales, desde las comarcas del Conflent, Vallespir y Rosellón, ofreciendo un recorrido completo por esta emblemática montaña.\n\nEl Canigó, considerado históricamente el pico más alto de los Pirineos debido a su espectacular ascenso desde el nivel del mar, presenta desniveles muy destacados. Esta travesía de varios días es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que buscan un gran tour de la montaña, combinando largas distancias con subidas sustanciales."}'::jsonb, 'Dani OnFire', 67464, 4102, 4102, 2785, 1089, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 31140, 17491, '2024-08-06', '2024-07', '[{"lat":42.501635,"lng":2.54846,"ele":1471},{"lat":42.501731,"lng":2.547678,"ele":1475.8},{"lat":42.501648,"lng":2.546985,"ele":1475.6},{"lat":42.501485,"lng":2.546703,"ele":1477.8},{"lat":42.501389,"lng":2.546045,"ele":1477.6},{"lat":42.501165,"lng":2.5458,"ele":1475.8},{"lat":42.500835,"lng":2.544723,"ele":1477},{"lat":42.500474,"lng":2.544192,"ele":1472.4},{"lat":42.500317,"lng":2.543472,"ele":1471.2},{"lat":42.500186,"lng":2.543645,"ele":1464},{"lat":42.500138,"lng":2.543945,"ele":1457.4},{"lat":42.500006,"lng":2.544152,"ele":1450},{"lat":42.499667,"lng":2.544198,"ele":1438.2},{"lat":42.499658,"lng":2.544278,"ele":1435.6},{"lat":42.499286,"lng":2.544595,"ele":1416.4},{"lat":42.499187,"lng":2.54459,"ele":1414},{"lat":42.499165,"lng":2.544718,"ele":1409.8},{"lat":42.498909,"lng":2.544832,"ele":1399.6},{"lat":42.498829,"lng":2.545078,"ele":1392.6},{"lat":42.498717,"lng":2.54508,"ele":1388.2},{"lat":42.49831,"lng":2.546007,"ele":1360.8},{"lat":42.498128,"lng":2.546043,"ele":1358.6},{"lat":42.49801,"lng":2.545965,"ele":1356},{"lat":42.497901,"lng":2.546032,"ele":1353.4},{"lat":42.497738,"lng":2.546462,"ele":1347.6},{"lat":42.49761,"lng":2.546612,"ele":1345.8},{"lat":42.497219,"lng":2.546922,"ele":1338.2},{"lat":42.497123,"lng":2.546925,"ele":1335.8},{"lat":42.497136,"lng":2.54704,"ele":1332.2},{"lat":42.496906,"lng":2.547143,"ele":1324.2},{"lat":42.496848,"lng":2.547077,"ele":1322},{"lat":42.496886,"lng":2.547348,"ele":1315.2},{"lat":42.496678,"lng":2.547325,"ele":1311.6},{"lat":42.49655,"lng":2.547433,"ele":1303.6},{"lat":42.496202,"lng":2.547497,"ele":1293.4},{"lat":42.49577,"lng":2.547862,"ele":1288},{"lat":42.49553,"lng":2.547928,"ele":1287},{"lat":42.495456,"lng":2.54812,"ele":1276.8},{"lat":42.495101,"lng":2.548335,"ele":1267.4},{"lat":42.495082,"lng":2.548197,"ele":1259.6},{"lat":42.495168,"lng":2.548025,"ele":1254.4},{"lat"