('wikiloc', '181997183', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/pic-de-gerri-circ-de-vallpeguera-i-baiau-pic-de-sanfonts-des-de-la-molinassa-181997183', 'Andorra: Pic de Gerri ,Circ de Vallpeguera i Baiau, Pic de Sanfonts des de La Molinassa', '{"en":"Long loop via Vallpeguera and Sanfonts","ca":"Circular llarga per Vallpeguera i Sanfonts","es":"Circular larga por Vallpeguera y Sanfonts"}'::jsonb, 'Andorra: Pic de Gerri ,Circ de Vallpeguera i Baiau, Pic de Sanfonts des de La Molinassa Hiking trail in Tor, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Pic de Gerri ,Circ de Vallpeduera i Baiau, Pic de Santfons des de La Molinassa', '{"en":"This challenging 17.3 km loop starts from La Molinassa and explores the high mountains of the Vallferrera region, bordering Andorra. The route ascends to Pic de Gerri before continuing through the scenic Circ de Vallpeguera and Baiau, culminating in an ascent to Pic de Sanfonts.\n\nWith a significant elevation gain of 1483m, this route is suitable for experienced hikers seeking a long and demanding day out in a remote mountain environment. The terrain is varied, traversing high mountain passes and offering extensive views.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular de 17.3 km comença des de La Molinassa i explora l''alta muntanya de la regió de la Vallferrera, fent frontera amb Andorra. La ruta ascendeix al Pic de Gerri abans de continuar pel pintoresc Circ de Vallpeguera i Baiau, culminant amb l''ascens al Pic de Sanfonts.\n\nAmb un desnivell acumulat de 1483m, aquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que busquen una jornada llarga i exigent en un entorn d''alta muntanya. El terreny és variat, travessant colls d''alta muntanya i oferint vistes extenses.","es":"Esta exigente ruta circular de 17.3 km comienza desde La Molinassa y explora la alta montaña de la región de Vallferrera, haciendo frontera con Andorra. La ruta asciende al Pic de Gerri antes de continuar por el pintoresco Circ de Vallpeguera y Baiau, culminando con el ascenso al Pic de Sanfonts.\n\nCon un desnivel acumulado de 1483m, esta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que buscan una jornada larga y exigente en un entorno de alta montaña. El terreno es variado, atravesando collados de alta montaña y ofreciendo vistas extensas."}'::jsonb, 'Jordi Vallès', 17284, 1483, 1483, 2893, 1815, 'difficult', 'loop', 23220, 32400, 2988, '2024-08-20', '2024-07', '[{"lat":42.62381,"lng":1.384146,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623859,"lng":1.384143,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623613,"lng":1.384335,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.62361,"lng":1.384401,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623567,"lng":1.38446,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623545,"lng":1.384527,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623535,"lng":1.384598,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.62355,"lng":1.384657,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623553,"lng":1.384734,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623551,"lng":1.384838,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623529,"lng":1.384907,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623508,"lng":1.384967,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623486,"lng":1.385029,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.62346,"lng":1.385095,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623426,"lng":1.385161,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.6234,"lng":1.385228,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623383,"lng":1.38529,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623363,"lng":1.385345,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623336,"lng":1.385409,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623294,"lng":1.385453,"ele":1820.1},{"lat":42.623243,"lng":1.385483,"ele":1820.4},{"lat":42.623199,"lng":1.385502,"ele":1820.9},{"lat":42.623152,"lng":1.38554,"ele":1821.1},{"lat":42.623099,"lng":1.385559,"ele":1821.1},{"lat":42.623045,"lng":1.385578,"ele":1821.3},{"lat":42.623,"lng":1.385593,"ele":1821.5},{"lat":42.622923,"lng":1.385643,"ele":1821.8},{"lat":42.622821,"lng":1.385732,"ele":1822},{"lat":42.62265,"lng":1.385874,"ele":1822.6},{"lat":42.622601,"lng":1.385886,"ele":1832.1},{"lat":42.622546,"lng":1.385916,"ele":1831.4},{"lat":42.622504,"lng":1.38595,"ele":1831},{"lat":42.622459,"lng":1.385962,"ele":1830.7},{"lat":42.622416,"lng":1.385986,"ele":1830.7},{"la